        "TileImage": "$($repository 456abdb7-86a8-43c7-8461-f0fca8f45659).Image",
        "Description": "Good Evening 47, we&apos;re coming back to Paris. After learning that Viktor Novikov had actually replaced himself with a double during the events of the Showstopper. We are coming back to Paris to now tie up our loose ends, the ICA has conducted intense research into this contract. These extra targets are people close to Novikov in aiding him for his stunt double. Good Luck 47.",
